                        "entry_id": "54a30909-6ab7-3964-ada1-140557ced3a9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "at some time; indefinitely; some time or other, sometime"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "nonstandard",
                            "not-comparable",
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d849fdba-6d91-4274-9348-e53b8302191a",
                                "sense_id": "bdf458a2-d7b3-35b1-8303-8b1bf86d0bef",
                                "text": "Out of the drift of facts, whereby you learn / What some was, somewhere, somewhen, somewhy?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec74f07e-15ac-4063-ac7e-14e9d0643ee5",
                                "sense_id": "bdf458a2-d7b3-35b1-8303-8b1bf86d0bef",
                                "text": "Yes, though nobody else should reproach me if we should stay together, yet somewhen, years hence, ..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ca1920c2-fa7e-4fac-893d-2dc0e43c155f",
                                "sense_id": "bdf458a2-d7b3-35b1-8303-8b1bf86d0bef",
                                "text": "An event is a particular thing that happens somewhere and somewhen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "612eacce-746e-4c3d-8fb1-4d549585d053",
                                "sense_id": "bdf458a2-d7b3-35b1-8303-8b1bf86d0bef",
                                "text": "… things always exist or occur somewhen as well. They exist or occur whenever — at whatever times-when — they in fact exist or occur, and not somewhen else."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "65efa81e-e7d4-4a63-98b6-856ad15ea034",
                                "sense_id": "bdf458a2-d7b3-35b1-8303-8b1bf86d0bef",
                                "text": "Somewhen, curling through the intricacies of tau, John/Johan still lived. Somewhen on this very planet he lived, …"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
